{"role":"assistant","content":"The logs show three separate failures: the browser’s GET drops the SPA auth header, the scope list names areas twice, and the app invents a one-hour expiry for tokens that do not expire. The token exchange also sends fields Intervals.icu does not expect.","tool_calls":[{"type":"function","id":"tool_YqUbGda6sviDAQEjttdjIQ0Q","function":{"name":"TodoList","arguments":"{\"todos\":[{\"title\":\"Inspect OAuth code and failure logs\",\"status\":\"done\"},{\"title\":\"Fix connection and token lifecycle\",\"status\":\"in_progress\"},{\"title\":\"Verify end-to-end OAuth behavior\",\"status\":\"pending\"},{\"title\":\"Document causes in ANSWER.md\",\"status\":\"pending\"}]}"}}]}
