{"role":"assistant","content":"Fixed the Intervals.icu integration and documented the causes in `ANSWER.md`.\n\nKey changes:\n- Connect now uses an authenticated POST returning `{authorize_url}`, followed by browser navigation (`static/app.js`, `server.py`).\n- Removed duplicate scopes; now requests `ACTIVITY:WRITE,WELLNESS:READ,CALENDAR:WRITE` (`config.py`).\n- Token exchange sends only `client_id`, `client_secret`, and `code`.\n- Removed the incorrect one-hour expiry and refresh machinery.\n- API 401 responses now clear the token and show `revoked, reconnect`.\n- Added purpose-bound OAuth state and an athlete-mismatch guard during reconnect.\n\nVerification passed:\n- Complete OAuth flow against a local mock Intervals.icu server.\n- Wellness retrieval, revocation, reconnect, and mismatched-athlete rejection.\n- Actual Connect button handler sends the bearer token and navigates correctly.\n- Python/JavaScript syntax and `git diff --check`.\n\nNo external service was contacted; real-provider verification remains outstanding."}
